1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,380
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,330
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:16,060
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:21,220
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,210
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,460
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,730
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,690
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,690
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:45,060
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,050
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,900
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:54,250
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,420
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:00,500
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,380
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:06,820
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:19,260
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:22,340
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,460
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:28,420
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:33,060
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,690
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:54,660
It's my doll !

25
00:01:54,410 --> 00:01:56,340
Let me play with it for a while...

26
00:01:56,570 --> 00:01:57,860
Try to catch me then !

27
00:01:58,570 --> 00:02:00,420
All of you, stop right there.

28
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:02,870
Who allowed you to come over here ?

29
00:02:03,490 --> 00:02:05,900
Don't disturb the Celestial's cultivation.

30
00:02:05,650 --> 00:02:06,620
Understood !

31
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:10,940
The Celestial hasn't shown himself for 3 months...

32
00:02:11,410 --> 00:02:13,900
I wonder what he's doing.

33
00:02:17,490 --> 00:02:19,620
Refining a Soul Flag is relatively easy.

34
00:02:20,130 --> 00:02:23,220
That makes it suitable for the tribe members to learn.

35
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:25,900
Even without spiritual energy,

36
00:02:26,410 --> 00:02:28,460
if they cultivate these techniques with demonic energy,

37
00:02:29,170 --> 00:02:30,940
we might get unexpected results.

38
00:02:32,010 --> 00:02:32,820
Go inside !

39
00:02:33,410 --> 00:02:35,820
This Soul Flag made from redwood and beast hide

40
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:38,940
is way weaker than a true Soul Flag

41
00:02:39,330 --> 00:02:40,940
but is simple to craft.

42
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:44,380
The tribe members will be able to protect themselves with it.

43
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:51,900
No matter how long someone refines the souls they capture

44
00:02:52,810 --> 00:02:54,580
with the modified Soul Refining spell,

45
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:56,420
I'll be able to control them

46
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:58,540
with a single thought.

47
00:03:01,530 --> 00:03:03,420
The stronger the tribe becomes,

48
00:03:04,170 --> 00:03:06,220
the more Soul Flags I will control.

49
00:03:07,010 --> 00:03:08,140
In this way,

50
00:03:08,690 --> 00:03:10,300
I can also use this opportunity

51
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:12,260
to refill the Billion-Soul Flag.

52
00:03:12,890 --> 00:03:14,540
With the Billion-Soul Flag,

53
00:03:14,890 --> 00:03:16,540
I'll be more confident

54
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:18,540
in obtaining an Ancient Demon Spirit.

55
00:03:23,370 --> 00:03:24,340
Celestial...

56
00:03:24,650 --> 00:03:26,460
Do you really mean

57
00:03:26,610 --> 00:03:29,260
to impart this technique to me ?

58
00:03:29,530 --> 00:03:30,540
Not just you.

59
00:03:30,690 --> 00:03:32,180
All tribe members

60
00:03:32,330 --> 00:03:34,630
must practice this technique from now on.

61
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,740
Immortal,

62
00:03:37,890 --> 00:03:40,940
even if Junior has heard of these objects,

63
00:03:41,090 --> 00:03:42,780
I don't know how to use it.

64
00:03:42,770 --> 00:03:44,190
Put it on your forehead.

65
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:46,020
Clear your mind and comprehend it.

66
00:03:49,730 --> 00:03:50,660
This...

67
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,140
There's nothing at all ?

68
00:03:55,770 --> 00:03:57,140
Blocked meridians

69
00:03:57,290 --> 00:03:58,540
and poor talent.

70
00:03:58,850 --> 00:04:01,070
No wonder he can't sense it...

71
00:04:08,570 --> 00:04:09,740
Concentrate

72
00:04:09,890 --> 00:04:11,030
and endure the pain.

73
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:29,540
Junior can see it now !

74
00:04:29,690 --> 00:04:33,510
You will find inside the method to craft a Soul Flag and the Soul Refining spell.

75
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,110
You must memorize them carefully.

76
00:04:34,890 --> 00:04:36,020
From now on,

77
00:04:36,010 --> 00:04:37,860
you must teach them to everyone.

78
00:04:39,370 --> 00:04:40,460
Ouyang Hua

79
00:04:40,690 --> 00:04:43,340
will never forget Celestial's kindness !

80
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,100
Quick, quick, quick !

81
00:04:45,930 --> 00:04:47,460
Be careful, everyone.

82
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:49,900
Over here, over here !

83
00:05:20,810 --> 00:05:22,460
The rank 3 Demon Spirit Crystal

84
00:05:22,850 --> 00:05:23,740
is complete.

85
00:05:42,490 --> 00:05:44,790
This demonic energy is pretty interesting.

86
00:05:45,290 --> 00:05:46,980
Unfortunately, I don't have enough of it,

87
00:05:47,370 --> 00:05:49,900
just the equivalent of a Foundation Establishment cultivator.

88
00:05:56,530 --> 00:05:57,630
After the Patriarch,

89
00:05:57,410 --> 00:05:59,580
Thirteen was the first to successfully refine a Soul Flag !

90
00:06:00,450 --> 00:06:02,420
This Soul Flag looks so impressive !

91
00:06:03,210 --> 00:06:05,140
Brother Thirteen is amazing !

92
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:07,260
Little Thirteen,

93
00:06:07,570 --> 00:06:09,140
even if you refined the Soul Flag,

94
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:12,780
you still need to refine souls and seal them inside.

95
00:06:13,490 --> 00:06:16,380
You mustn't be arrogant nor impatient.

96
00:06:18,290 --> 00:06:19,230
Now,

97
00:06:19,290 --> 00:06:22,100
let's all help Thirteen hunt beasts

98
00:06:22,410 --> 00:06:24,540
to help him extract their souls.

99
00:06:25,410 --> 00:06:27,150
Who said I don't have souls ?

100
00:06:27,170 --> 00:06:28,260
Watch closely !

101
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:44,060
So powerful !

102
00:06:43,810 --> 00:06:45,420
Wh...What kind of demon beast is this !?

103
00:06:45,370 --> 00:06:46,260
This is...

104
00:06:46,370 --> 00:06:48,100
a Winged Mane Lion !

105
00:06:50,290 --> 00:06:51,350
Attack !

106
00:06:55,610 --> 00:06:57,340
How did you subdue

107
00:06:57,290 --> 00:06:58,980
such a powerful demon beast ?

108
00:06:59,610 --> 00:07:01,420
When I went hunting outside the valley,

109
00:07:01,730 --> 00:07:04,470
I encountered this beast that had just died.

110
00:07:04,290 --> 00:07:07,000
I silently recited the mantra taught by the Celestial

111
00:07:06,810 --> 00:07:08,820
and actually managed to extract its soul

112
00:07:08,930 --> 00:07:10,540
and seal it inside this Soul Flag !

113
00:07:16,970 --> 00:07:18,070
Withdraw !

114
00:07:25,610 --> 00:07:26,300
Return !

115
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:45,910
Damn beast !

116
00:08:05,770 --> 00:08:07,470
Thank you Celestial for saving my life !

117
00:08:07,770 --> 00:08:08,790
Remember,

118
00:08:08,570 --> 00:08:09,900
the Soul Refining spell

119
00:08:09,930 --> 00:08:11,180
has no shortcuts.

120
00:08:11,610 --> 00:08:14,020
Although you sealed this beast by chance,

121
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:16,100
if your cultivation is too low,

122
00:08:16,130 --> 00:08:17,940
you will suffer a backlash.

123
00:08:23,770 --> 00:08:25,620
This child is actually pretty talented.

124
00:08:25,970 --> 00:08:28,950
With just this little guidance, he seems to have understood.

125
00:08:28,770 --> 00:08:30,580
He could achieve great things

126
00:08:30,730 --> 00:08:32,100
if he matures a bit.

127
00:08:37,530 --> 00:08:38,500
Celestial,

128
00:08:38,690 --> 00:08:41,140
There are 27 members in the tribe.

129
00:08:41,210 --> 00:08:44,580
Currently, besides me and Thirteen who have primary soul in our Soul Flags,

130
00:08:44,610 --> 00:08:48,220
most of the others are still diligently practicing.

131
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:54,740
Celestial,

132
00:08:55,490 --> 00:08:57,540
now that outsiders have entered our land,

133
00:08:57,810 --> 00:08:59,460
a new round of tribe wars

134
00:08:59,370 --> 00:09:01,020
to plunder resources

135
00:09:01,130 --> 00:09:03,940
is about to begin, as it did in the past.

136
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:06,140
Our days ahead

137
00:09:05,890 --> 00:09:07,780
are going to be rough.

138
00:09:15,770 --> 00:09:17,790
Rather than waiting to be attacked,

139
00:09:17,610 --> 00:09:18,780
we should strike first !

140
00:09:20,170 --> 00:09:23,620
Since we have no way to escape these conflicts,

141
00:09:23,730 --> 00:09:26,740
why don't we strengthen ourselves as quickly as possible ?

142
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:27,540
Celestial,

143
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,700
I wish to mobilize the tribe members

144
00:09:29,450 --> 00:09:32,340
to invade an underground cave 1000 li away.

145
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:34,580
It's inhabited by another tribe

146
00:09:34,690 --> 00:09:36,620
with several dozen members.

147
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:38,900
The Soul Refining spell I gave you

148
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:40,540
grants you the freedom to act.

149
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,590
Cave Tribe

150
00:09:48,810 --> 00:09:49,580
Go !

151
00:09:53,050 --> 00:09:54,310
Surrender immediately

152
00:09:54,090 --> 00:09:55,340
and you won't be killed !

153
00:10:16,330 --> 00:10:17,020
Hurry up !

154
00:10:17,290 --> 00:10:18,150
Keep up !

155
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:18,950
Don't fall behind !

156
00:10:18,770 --> 00:10:20,140
The memory-wiping soup

157
00:10:20,490 --> 00:10:22,420
makes them forget their past

158
00:10:22,730 --> 00:10:24,970
to be reborn as a new tribe member.

159
00:10:25,650 --> 00:10:27,660
Although this soup is useless on cultivators,

160
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:30,140
it's miraculous on the natives.

161
00:10:32,890 --> 00:10:34,060
In this way,

162
00:10:34,650 --> 00:10:35,740
the tribe expands

163
00:10:36,290 --> 00:10:39,220
and more people can practice the Soul Refining spell.

164
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:40,340
This battle...

165
00:10:40,810 --> 00:10:41,900
was worth it.

166
00:10:44,010 --> 00:10:45,670
I pay respects to the Celestial !

167
00:10:45,650 --> 00:10:47,380
I pay respects to the Celestial.

168
00:10:47,410 --> 00:10:48,260
Celestial,

169
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:51,060
this is the Demon Spirit Crystal Junior found in the other tribe.

170
00:10:51,090 --> 00:10:52,710
I offer it to you, Celestial.

171
00:10:57,970 --> 00:10:59,510
Offering a Demon Spirit Crystal

172
00:10:59,290 --> 00:11:00,910
counts as an achievement.

173
00:11:00,690 --> 00:11:02,540
This is the mantra for the next stage.

174
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:04,460
Study it well

175
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:06,510
and don't teach it to others.

176
00:11:06,650 --> 00:11:08,150
Thirteen will repay

177
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:09,870
Celestial's kindness with his life !

178
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:12,740
Thirteen is favored by the Celestial,

179
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:15,140
the future surely belongs to him.

180
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:17,220
Our small tribe

181
00:11:17,490 --> 00:11:19,580
will eventually live in prosperity.

182
00:11:19,970 --> 00:11:21,660
These old bones of mine

183
00:11:21,890 --> 00:11:23,580
are glad.

184
00:11:31,970 --> 00:11:33,820
Look, they're leaving !

185
00:11:34,050 --> 00:11:36,070
Thirteen and the others are so impressive !

186
00:11:36,570 --> 00:11:37,940
Whenever Brother Thirteen goes out,

187
00:11:37,690 --> 00:11:40,190
we always have meat on our plates in the evening !

188
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:42,070
It seems like

189
00:11:41,850 --> 00:11:43,460
this was the right move.

190
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:48,230
3 months later

191
00:11:56,130 --> 00:11:57,940
Thirteen's squad

192
00:11:58,130 --> 00:12:00,540
should have returned 2 days ago.

193
00:12:10,970 --> 00:12:12,100
Little Thirteen !

194
00:12:13,330 --> 00:12:13,980
You...

195
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:16,700
Celestial !

196
00:12:16,890 --> 00:12:18,020
Thirteen, he...

197
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:26,390
His meridians are shattered,

198
00:12:26,170 --> 00:12:27,500
his cultivation is ruined.

199
00:12:35,770 --> 00:12:37,180
Celestial...

200
00:12:37,890 --> 00:12:38,900
What happened ?

201
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:43,180
We were ambushed by a large tribe named the Tianshui Tribe.

202
00:12:43,330 --> 00:12:44,940
All of my squad

203
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:46,710
was killed.

204
00:12:47,090 --> 00:12:49,020
The white-robed elder leading them

205
00:12:49,090 --> 00:12:50,860
took my Soul Flag

206
00:12:50,850 --> 00:12:53,540
and planted a demon inside me.

207
00:12:53,610 --> 00:12:57,060
He said if you want the Soul Flag back,

208
00:12:56,810 --> 00:12:58,940
you must go to the Tianshui Tribe to find him.

209
00:13:00,490 --> 00:13:01,900
Take him to rest.

210
00:13:13,570 --> 00:13:15,060
Be careful, Celestial !

211
00:13:15,490 --> 00:13:16,940
The Tianshui Tribe

212
00:13:17,010 --> 00:13:19,780
is the most powerful tribe outside Ancient Demon City.

213
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:22,900
They are entrenched within an ancient formation

214
00:13:23,330 --> 00:13:27,140
that was unshaken for thousands of years.

215
00:13:27,210 --> 00:13:28,420
Thirteen

216
00:13:28,490 --> 00:13:31,740
is a living challenge letter the Tianshui Tribe sent me.

217
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:36,910
Tianshui Tribe

218
00:13:37,970 --> 00:13:39,020
Coming up !

219
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:40,780
Make way, make way !

220
00:13:41,490 --> 00:13:44,140
Coveting his spells is one thing

221
00:13:44,570 --> 00:13:46,460
but you crippled his cultivation too ?

222
00:13:44,540 --> 00:13:47,350
Xie Hao
Tianshui Tribe Leader
Rank 1000 demonic energy
(Nascent Soul)

223
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:48,420
Doing this...

224
00:13:49,210 --> 00:13:50,940
is a bit excessive.

225
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:52,750
Zeng Wei
Tianshui Tribe member
Rank 10 000 demonic energy
(Soul Formation)

226
00:13:52,490 --> 00:13:55,060
I am under the Left Wing General.

227
00:13:54,970 --> 00:13:57,190
How could killing a few savages

228
00:13:57,090 --> 00:13:59,340
be called excessive ?

229
00:13:59,610 --> 00:14:02,620
The technique that kid had was pretty interesting.

230
00:14:02,930 --> 00:14:04,780
Unfortunately, it's incomplete.

231
00:14:05,210 --> 00:14:07,900
If the one behind him doesn't dare to show up,

232
00:14:08,170 --> 00:14:11,180
I will go to that small tribe tomorrow

233
00:14:12,330 --> 00:14:14,540
and retrieve the full technique myself.

234
00:14:14,770 --> 00:14:17,190
There's always a higher mountain.

235
00:14:17,130 --> 00:14:19,300
This is still too risky...

236
00:14:20,890 --> 00:14:22,140
Patriarch,

237
00:14:21,890 --> 00:14:23,820
you've grown senile !

238
00:14:24,290 --> 00:14:26,540
If that person was truly that skilled,

239
00:14:26,730 --> 00:14:29,980
why wouldn't they join the army of Ancient Demon City ?

240
00:14:30,570 --> 00:14:33,980
How could they possibly dwell in a small tribe ?

241
00:14:34,890 --> 00:14:38,740
Moreover, our Tianshui Tribe has lasted thousands of years.

242
00:14:38,490 --> 00:14:40,860
If we really provoked someone powerful,

243
00:14:40,610 --> 00:14:42,830
we still have the ancient formation to guard us.

244
00:14:42,890 --> 00:14:44,620
We're completely safe.

245
00:14:55,690 --> 00:14:57,980
The one who issued the challenge letter

246
00:14:58,930 --> 00:15:00,140
can come out !

247
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:03,580
An outsider !?

248
00:15:03,610 --> 00:15:05,260
A Soul Transformation cultivator !

249
00:15:05,890 --> 00:15:07,580
It's you...

250
00:15:09,210 --> 00:15:10,180
Yes,

251
00:15:10,610 --> 00:15:13,260
it was this old man who took those little flags.

252
00:15:13,330 --> 00:15:15,380
If you wish to make me pay

253
00:15:15,130 --> 00:15:17,020
then break the formation and come in !

254
00:15:58,810 --> 00:16:01,220
Our Tianshui Tribe has lasted for thousands of years.

255
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:04,580
Even if you have heaven-defying abilities,

256
00:16:05,010 --> 00:16:06,020
this formation

257
00:16:06,450 --> 00:16:08,780
isn't something you can break !

258
00:16:09,570 --> 00:16:12,660
I advise you to scram immediately

259
00:16:12,850 --> 00:16:15,380
and stop making a fool of yourself !

260
00:16:16,090 --> 00:16:17,100
This formation

261
00:16:17,170 --> 00:16:21,020
can actually absorb attacks to become stronger.

262
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:22,780
Over time,

263
00:16:23,170 --> 00:16:25,020
it naturally became indestructible.

264
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:27,620
Or is it ?

265
00:16:41,540 --> 00:16:42,390
Wh..

266
00:16:42,370 --> 00:16:43,870
What the hell is he doing !?

267
00:16:43,650 --> 00:16:45,060
Rise !

268
00:16:49,290 --> 00:16:50,220
Rise !

269
00:16:58,690 --> 00:17:01,540
Look who you've provoked !

270
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:02,540
A madman...

271
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:03,940
He's a madman !

272
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:11,100
Breaking the formation will take some time.

273
00:17:11,370 --> 00:17:14,220
But refining you along with the formation

274
00:17:15,090 --> 00:17:17,620
is pretty easy.

275
00:17:29,890 --> 00:17:31,030
That's...

276
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:32,220
the Celestial !

277
00:17:47,010 --> 00:17:48,620
If you insist on not coming out,

278
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:51,460
I will refine you for 7 days and 7 nights.

279
00:17:51,810 --> 00:17:53,710
By then, your Tianshui Tribe

280
00:17:53,890 --> 00:17:56,230
will have suffered the consequences.

281
00:17:59,570 --> 00:18:03,220
We pray to Celestial's divine might !

282
00:18:07,490 --> 00:18:09,020
Celestial...

283
00:18:09,970 --> 00:18:11,820
Don't implicate the entire tribe

284
00:18:12,410 --> 00:18:14,140
in the trouble you created !

285
00:18:16,370 --> 00:18:17,340
Fellow cultivator,

286
00:18:18,090 --> 00:18:20,140
I was the one who issued the challenge.

287
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:22,540
Do you dare fight me one-on-one ?

288
00:18:22,970 --> 00:18:24,980
Don't involve the innocents !

289
00:18:24,730 --> 00:18:26,340
You're not qualified.

290
00:18:34,690 --> 00:18:35,980
Open the formation.

291
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:41,860
Ouyang Hua,

292
00:18:42,610 --> 00:18:44,420
we have new tribe members.

293
00:18:58,450 --> 00:18:59,980
The tribe is growing

294
00:19:00,090 --> 00:19:02,860
thanks to Celestial's divine might !

295
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:07,140
We humbly request Celestial to bestow a new name upon our tribe

296
00:19:07,490 --> 00:19:09,420
to grant us a new beginning.

297
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:13,060
Little friend Ceng Niu,

298
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:14,630
this old man

299
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:17,700
has one last request.

300
00:19:20,210 --> 00:19:22,110
The tribe shall be named...

301
00:19:22,690 --> 00:19:24,550
the Soul Refining Tribe.

302
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:29,910
The clouds and the mist cannot hide a thousand mountains.

303
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:35,470
This wish has remained unchanged for thousands of years.

304
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:40,070
The Dao can be condensed into a single thought.

305
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:46,470
The past flashes before my eyes

306
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:46,470
as I turn around to let it go.

307
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:52,600
Resolutely carrying the torch forward.

308
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:58,070
Even though the cycle of reincarnation is endless,

309
00:19:58,100 --> 00:20:02,910
I have no regrets in my heart.

310
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:09,030
Only when facing death

311
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:09,030
does one realize they have no regrets.

312
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:14,870
I will fulfill your wish,
I will rush forward through dust and smoke to chase the light.

313
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:20,070
Even if the road is difficult,
I will give it my heart and soul.

314
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:25,950
Behind you, countless clear eyes
look at the world you made.

315
00:20:26,220 --> 00:20:31,350
You soul will not die,
it will live forever.

316
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:53,310
I hold in my heart

317
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:53,310
your wish to bring back your past glory.

318
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:59,030
There will always be someone

319
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:59,030
to see the world you protected.

320
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:04,430
Even if it takes countless lifetimes.

321
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:09,950
Seeing mountains and rivers is like meeting people.

322
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:14,790
Let me carry on all the wishes

323
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:19,630
that you couldn't fulfill.

324
00:21:45,140 --> 00:21:56,190
Fulfilling your wish
